factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 7 problems
  The tamil_headline places the price drop in 'தீபாவளி முடிந்ததால்' (because Deepavali ended) and names 'குளித்தலை, தோகைமலை' as the location; the article says the festival season (including Deepavali) ended, so this is acceptable, but the headline mixes the place list with a cause phrasing that is not a single clear fact.
  The reel_script states the Karthigai 17 date as 'கார்த்திகை 17ஆம் தேதி' and the vratam start as a fact; the article says Karthigai month starts on the 17th, so the day is slightly reframed as the Karthigai date rather than the month start, which is a distortion.
  The reel_script omits the article's note that the Surasamharam event and Karthigai Deepam festival are upcoming, which are context facts; more importantly it says 'ஆயுத பூஜையின் போது ரூ.800 வரை' correctly but the slides_spec line 'ஆயுத பூஜையின் போது ₹800 வரை விலை போன' is accurate, so no issue there.
